  [SG2 VERDICT] THE VERDICT CLASS IS READING-RELATIVE, and this is the whole finding: over the 66 (cell, reading, coupling) evaluations of the product-closed channel family the census is COLLAPSE 16, STRUCTURED 10, NO-COLLAPSE 24, SUPPORT-MISMATCH 7, BOTH-ZERO 9, of which 50 are DISCRIMINATING (both rules' identified operators nonzero, so a common ray is even definable), at relative deviations 3.9928e-51 to 1.43934 against the 1e-30 gate. The 16 COLLAPSE evaluations occur under reading(s) NPC, NPR, OCC0, OCC1, OCC2, OCC3 at coupling(s) g=0 — b=0 r<=2 NPC at g=0 (c = -86299/160000); b=0 r<=2 NPR at g=0 (c = 204703/480000); b=0 r<=2 OCC0 at g=0 (c = 1084027/4320000); b=0 r<=2 OCC1 at g=0 (c = 1115477/4320000); b=0 r<=2 OCC2 at g=0 (c = 2600627/4320000); b=0 r<=3 NPC at g=0 (c = -86299/160000); b=0 r<=3 NPR at g=0 (c = 204703/480000); b=0 r<=3 OCC0 at g=0 (c = 3672727/4320000); b=0 r<=3 OCC1 at g=0 (c = 2409827/4320000); b=0 r<=3 OCC2 at g=0 (c = 11927/4320000); b=1 r<=2 NPC at g=0 (c = -119499/160000); b=1 r<=2 NPR at g=0 (c = 265103/480000); b=1 r<=2 OCC0 at g=0 (c = -1100791/1440000); b=1 r<=2 OCC1 at g=0 (c = 2867809/1440000); b=1 r<=2 OCC2 at g=0 (c = 416089/1440000); b=1 r<=2 OCC3 at g=0 (c = 313427/4320000) — and NOT under the finest reading FULL, which is consistent with the declared one-way rule (a collapse at FULL implies one in every coarsening; the converse does not hold); the SEC reading is annihilated by the zero-sum lemma (SG2-B) and carries no discrimination, and the PAR reading has an identically zero EXC side (SG2-E), so no common ray is definable there either.

